not a legal conclusion about ownership.

The intended maintainer must confirm ownership and select an appropriate license
before any public release. Reimplementation alone does not establish those rights.

Third-party dependencies and system components retain their own licenses. The
development-only PHPStan package includes its own MIT license in its installed
distribution. PHP, SQLite and CUPS are separately installed runtime/system
components; none of their implementation source is bundled in this source package.

